    "accessibility": {
      "features": [],
      "notes": ""
    },
    "access": "This church is located right in front of the town's main square, so you can get there by car and park nearby. Access is free, though sometimes only open during mass hours or special activities.",
    "recommendations": {
      "tips": "Visit with respect, even if you're not religious. It is perfect for photos, reflection or simply to appreciate the living history of the town. And since you're here, take the opportunity to walk through the square, which is usually full of local culture."
    }
  },
